Lua-cURLv3 (lcurl native binding; libcurl must be installed on the host).

URL:    https://github.com/Lua-cURL/Lua-cURLv3
Commit: 9f8b6dba8b5ef1b26309a571ae75cda4034279e5
License: MIT (see upstream LICENSE)

Sources are not vendored in git. `scripts/watchdog-lua-deps.sh` downloads this
pinned tarball at build time into `.deps/lua-curl-src/<sha>/` and compiles
`lcurl.so` into `.deps/lua/`. Pin is also recorded in `release/versions.env`
as `LUA_CURL_UPSTREAM_SHA`.

We build only the lcurl C module — not the optional `cURL/*.lua` helper layer.
